<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλησμον-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a being filled, satiety,</i> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδεια, κένωσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				571e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Smp.</u>
				186c
			</span></i>; esp. with food, <i>repletion, surfeit,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτε π. οὔτε μέθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					4.2.40
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.62K.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς πλησμονάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1211
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πλησμονῇ τοι Κύπρις, ἐν πεινῶντι
					δ᾽ οὔ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					895
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθίειν εἰς π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					16.3
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν μὲν γὰρ ἄλλων ἐστὶ πάντων π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					189
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				1.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὑγροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					7.62
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμῆς τε καὶ νίκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					586d
				</span></i>
			, etc.; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					837c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nigr.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>abundance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Pr.</u>
				3.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				1.10.8
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
